 "remarks": "Discover serene living at 95 Louise's Lane, a modern oasis available for rent at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac. This stunning home offers breathtaking pond and river views, blending tranquility with proximity to vibrant downtown New Canaan and nearby Pound Ridge. Featuring 5 spacious bedrooms with nature-inspired views, this home is perfect for those seeking comfort and elegance. The open first-floor layout, with sleek white floors and walls framed by expansive windows, creates a bright and inviting space ideal for entertaining. Upstairs, a versatile great room with a loft is perfect for cozy movie nights or memorable gatherings. Outside, enjoy a private bluestone terrace and a refreshing dip in the cutting-edge modpool. Experience sophisticated rental living in a peaceful setting.",
